{"id":10000094,"name":"千织","enName":"Chiori","title":"鸣雷的裁锦师","element":"岩","region":"稻妻","rarity":5,"weapon":"单手剑","birthday":"8月17日","constellation":"丝切铗座","description":"「千织屋」的老板。枫丹著名服装设计师。","affiliation":"枫丹廷","cv":{"chinese":"陈阳","japanese":"竹达彩奈","english":"布兰妮·劳达","korean":"李多恩"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000094-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000094-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Chiori.zip","voicePackageEn":"Chiori","quoteCount":68,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我叫千织，「千织屋」的老板。有服装定制类需求的话，欢迎找我。其他需求，就看你有没有足够用来交换的东西了，有来有回才叫「生意」嘛。另外，「千织屋」内严禁抽烟喝酒，寻衅闹事。「顾客即是神明」那一套在我这里不管用，就算来的真是神明，不守规矩被丢出去的时候，也一样是屁股着地。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/eb48p7lihtszp3j1lglalimcc5uwg64.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·评价","desc":"我来决定自己该怎么走，要成为谁。没人能对我指手画脚。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/pho0gxx93go2jtpmgmdcs607tulaonf.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·裁缝刀","desc":"谁说裁衣服一定要用剪刀？那些死板的规矩由它去吧，我喜欢自己用着顺手的刀具。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/k280oa88d8idt3m7k86cjkrb88o9w96.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·模特","desc":"真要站着不动的话，干脆来当我的模特吧。给你设计款好看的衣服。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/3s7xgo4y3j7irx64pcv5fplabrqg9ly.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"比起下雨，我更讨厌地上泥水，溅到衣服上就很难洗掉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/rn71kmwie08lp0w0vq0178prrh1wu85.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"…想起了家乡往日的风景。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/06/erd40okq2r5dkk1posobcf2u5qgosqv.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"清高却令人向往…落到手上的一瞬，这份美丽又随之消散…雪花这东西，和「时尚」还真像…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/33tucuxkcs4olxy5dz4t8rw01tg8tmi.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"真难想象这种地方要怎么推行时尚。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/pjodday8dp3x74cmzdxk2s72zu4adg3.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早，别指望我会给你变出早饭来。你如果去咖啡厅的话就帮我带一杯咖啡来吧，不加奶，不加糖。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/splh5xp6wc4uhrwu75f1bczprfz6ahu.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"已经这个点了？肚子完全不饿啊…我不打算停下手头的活。午饭你自己吃就好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e1/5puiq2x2548kq2x2wac7cswxjaamn7h.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"外面好吵。全枫丹廷的人都出来逛街了吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/dzzo81syh9tbq3g1qbidvi903547gz6.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"我要去好好泡个澡放松一下。不多聊了，明天见。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/26/p9zo99vtmlpo7zg3pkt82c03e723rq6.mp3"},{"title":"关于自己·直接","desc":"很多人明里暗里表达过我的性格不够好，说话不够委婉，容易伤人。依我说，那种谁都看得出来的寒暄、客套和恭维才是在浪费彼此的时间吧？要是挑明事实就会受伤，那人也太脆弱了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/83khhkevxr0whcp4xswdgwzkcj87h34.mp3"},{"title":"关于自己·理念","desc":"最初构想品牌理念的时候，我想到了很多过去的经历，也由此提炼出了不少关键词。取舍是一件难事，尤其是你发现每一枚宝石都折射着你的一种想法…而你只能挑选最能代表你的那一枚。\n「永不认输」。那才是我，才是我的品牌。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/rdnvk4w6b7aakemyxyd6j89joquvf95.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·试衣","desc":"听我的，这件适合你。什么？之前没见过这样的款式？呵，那是你之前遇到的设计师没品味。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/k35fw8vs1zpzkw18tjd4yclu8ilcc1y.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·交换","desc":"事到如今再说这话有点晚了，但我向来是想说什么就说什么，你恐怕也习惯了。我不打算改变自己直来直往的作风，你也尽管在我面前表露最真实的自己吧，无须掩藏。我保证不会对你有所指摘。不信？你认识我那么久，我有说到但做不到的时候吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/bn1iaq7nfr8azavlofuwwap117pv00i.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"因为我的出身，枫丹人称呼我为「鸣雷的裁锦师」。爱怎么称呼怎么称呼吧，我对故乡没什么依恋的感情，毕竟就连我的「神之眼」，都是在我决定离开稻妻时获得的。\n但我也不讨厌那个晒不干布料的地方，对我来说，只是没必要回去而已。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/jq90ve10opykkfd52xkbsvib3dd2d71.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"为了治我小时候好动的性格，父母送我去学过很多东西，「剑道」就是其中之一。但学了一阵子后，我突然觉得双手用刀很称我意，也很厉害，结果却被剑道老师制止了。我问他为什么，他只说这不是主流刀法，有些「不伦不类」。自那之后，我就再没去上过他的课。现在想想，当初坚持自己喜欢的用法真是太好了。或许，我天生就是两只手都闲不下来吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/84/q0iniqiqxo3eno4hpp9t3jsapvc78mf.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"「袖」是我的第一件作品，那时只想缝一个跟自己差不多模样的女孩，作为模特和帮手。嗯？陪伴？我没这种需要。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/55h07uvq7o4cojhg4792eh1fn0pcio9.mp3"},{"title":"关于娜维娅…","desc":"她曾经很认真地「拜托」我设计各种奇奇怪怪的东西，比如为船舵的每个把手都设计一个不同的头冠。那时我忍不住翻了个白眼，说我最多把她的帽子设计成一条船。\n那些说我想法超前的人恐怕是没跟娜维娅聊过天。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_navia_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/2iu7nyukji5wfhxfxpwhq05b4vaqawa.mp3"},{"title":"关于林尼…","desc":"我做不出一顶能隐藏秘密的礼帽，但他通过魔术可以。有时我很好奇，他的帽子里装了那么多的秘密，戴起来会是什么感觉。对我来说，还是想到什么就说出来会比较轻松。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_lyney_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/7xmrl2qriy804dloctmulk16435fa53.mp3"},{"title":"关于琳妮特…","desc":"这位助手小姐不太说话，但她很信任我。我似乎很讨猫喜欢啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_lynette_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/j42hdi1lanv9d4n4lhncnpk9fymtf9u.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏洛蒂…","desc":"有次夏洛蒂来店里想采访我，我说别了又没什么新鲜事。结果她刚一出门，就有个醉汉来店里闹事，被她记录下了全程…真是见了鬼了。只听说过记者追新闻，现在还有新闻会追记者？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_charlotte_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/pmbfuvblliu819thnbvy3wtorvujrma.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏沃蕾…","desc":"和夏沃蕾的合作与谈话都很省力。这导致每次跟她告别，重新面对顾客的时候，我都有种不适应的感觉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_chevreuse_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/kxr7pj78nhy8ntla17y18wwxhtspmum.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾梅莉埃…","desc":"艾梅莉埃的香水很受欢迎。出于商业合作，我会请她将试做中的香水小样送到「千织屋」，让爱洛芙悄悄喷在顾客们使用的试衣间，然后我再将顾客们的反馈告诉她。但这么长时间下来，没有一位顾客说我试衣间里的味道奇怪，反倒是纷纷来问我店里的香水哪里有卖。出于好奇，每次她发售香水成品的时候，我也会买一瓶来闻闻。不得不说，那种每次都能品出新鲜感的香味，实为天才之作。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_emilie_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/sdu81y0w7limb3yd83pk25jf2xvg7f0.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱欧斯利…","desc":"一些朋友和合作者向我聊起过他，我很佩服他的手腕，但我也没打算改变自己的做事方式。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_wriothesley_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/6wcaffr3fb6dp5s0e9z2gq8tzpcr5f7.mp3"},{"title":"关于绮良良…","desc":"从前在稻妻，我到野外找设计灵感的时候，总有只绿眼睛的猫喜欢跟在我身边。那家伙好像对我手上布料的颜色和花纹很感兴趣，心情好了还会蹭蹭我的小腿。\n后来，我一眼就认出了这个绿眼睛、背后还长着两条尾巴的女孩。她看那些新奇东西的眼神，这么多年就没有变过。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_kirara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/8azve60qqz8hftow0mzvgg4vxvke28a.mp3"},{"title":"关于神里绫华…","desc":"如果不是儿时贪玩，我恐怕也不会有机会认识这位神里家的大小姐。有次我翻进了神里家的院子，她的手鞠恰好滚到墙边。她见到我时既惊讶又兴奋，我陪她玩了好一会儿，又聊了很久的天…但最后我还是被人发现了，于是这短暂的友情就以我被人提了出去而告终。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_teammate_ayaka_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/e6l11zd8hybgjt625bmjcnxm3n2641u.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解千织·其一","desc":"我自认为脾气没有人们说的那么差，我只是不喜欢在破事上浪费时间而已。但不知是什么原因，那些「破事」总是缠着我不放。久而久之，就落得了个不好的名声，我才想叫冤枉呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/8e8lyvquyzdgjo2nukxbkj1j4gcknl0.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解千织·其二","desc":"我从小就不喜欢被管教，有段时间特别讨厌「规矩」这东西，一定要和它对着干。托这倔脾气的福，我吃了不少苦头。但后来我渐渐明白，「规矩」不全是坏事。我真正讨厌的，是那种不能按自己想法做出决定的感觉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/79/jfuje6g2cbnagtna81qcu681ufsnxsj.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解千织·其三","desc":"小时候最期待的，就是家乡夏日的祭典。每到那时，人们就会穿上最好看的衣服上街…\n腰带上五颜六色的水球、怎么都捞不起的金鱼、还有甜到腻人的苹果糖和长野原家的烟花…那时玩得很开心，但回到家后，却总觉得少了什么。现在才知道，那时的我，是不想只做「观众」…\n就像提到烟花，人们就想到「长野原」一样。我希望有一天，人们想穿上祭典的，都是「千织屋」的衣服。\n…哈，光是这么想想，就感觉心中充满激情。嗯，我要回店里做衣服去了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/cpwkvzeydqlai5gs6sbrubajial0jg8.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解千织·其四","desc":"虽然工作起来很投入，但我也喜欢享受当下的时光。闲下来的时候，我会一个人带上些吃的，找个风景好的地方静静睡个午觉，晚上再听些喜欢的音乐，美美睡去…有时候则是叫上朋友们吃顿饭，大家在一起谈天说地，开个不醉不归的派对…想怎么做全看当时的心情。正如「时尚」只存在于「当下」一样，我也喜欢活在当下。怎么样？不如今晚我们就出去狠狠放松一下？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/o8cqrbrniza5mwmvzn6caq9f28xdotd.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解千织·其五","desc":"我喜欢稻妻的点心、喜欢清淡的食物…我喜欢家乡布料的触感、喜欢每天结束后泡个澡…但我也喜欢枫丹温柔的海水、喜欢海里美不胜收的景色…\n我常常会想，自己是否并没有摆脱「过去」对我造成的影响，是否今天的一切都是命中注定…\n但那又如何呢？我就是我，活在此刻。就算过去的一切塑造了如今的我，未来的路，也依旧由我自己选择，谁都无法改变这点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/1lpzn2llbdcyd47939vv1n3npvf4yqm.mp3"},{"title":"千织的爱好…","desc":"我在工作中追寻梦想，在爱好中探索自由。如果我每天做的事不是自己热爱的，那还有什么意思？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/echsl5orn991dbmom3fylo9lse0ag58.mp3"},{"title":"千织的烦恼…","desc":"我偶尔烦恼，追求理想的进度比预期更缓慢，这样下去不知我的品牌什么时候才能风靡世界。但我绝不会向现实妥协，烦恼又有什么帮助呢？还不如省下这个时间，多做几件衣服。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/msrx9zhjj80snjrlqynufxl1uv9j15a.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"我忘不了小时候吃过的那些稻妻点心。但比起品尝时的喜悦，我更享受制作的过程。要不是布料的色彩与变化更丰富一些，恐怕这世上，就要多一个点心师傅了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/2ng9rxbg7plla5oe6tyccbsm5vriple.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"就拿羊杂哈吉斯举例吧，我吃不惯味道浓厚的菜。就像是好好地走在路上，冷不防被岩飘浮灵糊了一脸一样…我这么形容你能理解吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/i1iv9me52cj2zo3nx1mt7r4utsurpzn.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"嗯，这味道我很喜欢，下次再带给我点。放心，我也会给你回礼的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/8z1xe4g3gh301mdd2z4e8gtwx16qhra.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"不错的手艺，适合工作累了之后，坐在店里慢慢品尝。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/47qw0edsirx7kw041mhxg68wqgiwzx0.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"这味道我不喜欢，下次换个清淡点的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/qidi86dpxvzw5yzectxz5zcrlrl33c6.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐。我懒得猜了，想要什么礼物就直说。嗯？太直接了？好吧，那就叫上娜维娅和绮良良她们，再约几个你的朋友，晚上来「千织屋」开派对。我参考参考他们会送你什么，然后当场做一个适合你的首饰送给你，保证你喜欢。我有这个自信。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/46kk3x928dx9vbxn1nlfu4ige8fn2rq.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"…不行，还是太普通。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/72/ti9upvjlkd4xi6kuihjodon85z67y95.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"…还不错，但少了点引人驻足的亮点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3b/0o5wkc6qdjsrl1lnb3u7zhhrstts677.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"…好，我抓到我想要的了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/n7n20iqi92jmzu10gsni2nfab0vraxh.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"我的手是不会抖的，这是我的专业性…但我得承认，此时此刻我的心跳声实在有些吵了。感谢你一路帮助我完成我的作品，它对我有着无比重要的意义。今后的路，我会更有把握。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/rtj2x5a2oqd8o66uomaaviayz84b4jd.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"袖。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/pcmkabf1olh52zfmg5gl0zg1pn8spm8.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"下一位？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/g7hauuzevtrjjxwct4r9ovprf3j3u57.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"搭把手。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/fvo1cfina3uhk944dt0igpjfjq52gvz.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"风尚，由我裁定。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/guqdrp27k65khrvazzj6am46gswbikq.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"脆如绸锦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/dds7wota1l6bsxpl7t64p6jhrjlsj8p.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"千红零落。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/pomgmnk9z2p6g4klux5h6ksoacgjnx1.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"这工艺还行吧，我做过比这更好的。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/3gcoe2acjxcr1d7axlmrx569mqrs1b8.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"原来你喜欢这种？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/064exb6obz4m834ajhnnpy8zwrlmmgg.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"嗯…我参考参考。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a8/rgx4e6iu71cxtkshajx2onchrihz9ij.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"衣服都破了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/95/fttdmvkrt78ap0oq0udz8dbpxrj5k3e.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"闹够了没有…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/dehcp0otf66t0cwk09ve91fwcysq2jj.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"得给你点教训…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/35/41fgdh4k6iijh2k6au3z9epg02h4x2u.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"喂，别逞强。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/44/9wspalgktpkbekrkh65j831u4xrzfud.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我可不做寿衣。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/dxgsgd94lv1a04v3cre0s04n8xrvpzu.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"裁剪不当…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/82/ptersf8a8x5o7s0ovpm3n0qinjxb0tk.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"我不认输…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/1mnd4it9m514pn8wtnpp2sln4f1bj35.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"我的品牌…还没有…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/2rff2cbpannziftuzqjkglbbx8xa96h.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"就这点？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/84jfflhimis1aknmz0bou5lfdd43a0t.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"没品味的家伙…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/60lsena0p7glrtmhr0164ftrzl0akyk.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"你惹错人了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_chiori/vo_chiori_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/dc78bet5zr056p2q38pjjpnt5xv9cnv.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"欢迎光临「千织屋」。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_chiori_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/l4o5bdp0zw51g3gyjdfwse7z3w30njt.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"需要定制服务吗？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_chiori_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/tmsxy9gn3banxs051oufoy2v0yv9f4f.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"出门找找灵感吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_chiori_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/tnqkm6agduocif5q85y5oyspu9qy5gv.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000094-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000094-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1313,"fullArtHeight":1019}